# Alfonso + fleet session artifacts (drafts, task outputs, historian, context) —
# never repo content. A fired spec draft writes into .cortexkit/alfonso/drafts/;
# without this ignore it dirties the parent repo and blocks every mason worktree
# dispatch. The nested negation keeps a future .cortexkit/alfonso/rules/ tracked.
.cortexkit/*
!.cortexkit/alfonso/
.cortexkit/alfonso/*
!.cortexkit/alfonso/rules/

# AFT-generated codebase analysis docs (regenerated from source, not authored) —
# kept out of the repo so generated content never churns the tree.
ARCHITECTURE.md
STRUCTURE.md

# Internal design material stays out of the repository by policy.
docs/design/
docs/field-notes.md

# Rust build artifacts.
target/
